silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_01_polynomial_form_concrete_anchor#publishoperationsort a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.chapters.01_signature_calculus.sections.01_polynomial_form.concrete_anchor#publishoperationsort" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_01_polynomial_form_concrete_anchor#publishoperationsort silm:hasLongDescription "The PublishOperationSort is PublishOperationSort: the set {ingest, type, validate, render}; the four stages of the publish factorization that form the signature S of the encyclopedia free monad; each element of S is a publish operation." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_01_polynomial_form_concrete_anchor#arity_1_ingest a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.chapters.01_signature_calculus.sections.01_polynomial_form.concrete_anchor#arity_1_ingest" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_01_polynomial_form_concrete_anchor#arity_1_ingest silm:hasLongDescription "The Arity_1_Ingest is Arity_1_Ingest: the arity 1 assigned to the ingest operation; one recursive argument position in the ingest functor; Sigma_{ingest}(X) = X (one copy, labeled as ingested). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'r(ingest)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_01_polynomial_form_concrete_anchor#vetrecord_77 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
