silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_01_polynomial_form_concrete_anchor#vetrecord_77 silm:hasLongDescription "The VetRecord_77 is VetRecord_77: the concrete carrier set element used to instantiate the polynomial functor; Sigma(VetRecord_77) = four tagged copies (ingest, type, validate, render) of VetRecord_77. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'X (carrier)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
