silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_01_polynomial_form_concrete_anchor#fourcopyvetrecord silm:hasLongDescription "The FourCopyVetRecord is FourCopyVetRecord: the concrete result of Sigma(VetRecord_77) = VetRecord_77_{ingest} + VetRecord_77_{type} + VetRecord_77_{validate} + VetRecord_77_{render}; four disjoint tagged copies representing VetRecord_77 at each publish stage." .
